[task.9]
title  = "Final checkpoint — Cody complete"
status = "pending"
note   = "All six properties green. The per-user environment runs on Railway (Ubuntu 24.04 service + volume, /data + /workspace, wake-on-request scale-to-zero) behind a provider-neutral Provisioner with Fly intact as fallback. codyd serves the Cody engine beside Neo: an orchestrator that Plans, Specs, and Delegates — one fresh-context worker per task executing a self-contained sheet, turn-ins independently verified (green verification + goal-vs-outcome adjudication) before acceptance, bounded classified re-dispatch, worker transcripts discarded so the orchestrator stays lean over long horizons, progress durable in cortex and resumable across restarts. Modes Prototype / Engineer / Architect dial ceremony while the engine-enforced constitution (no fakes, verify-before-done, read-full, honest partials, complete artifacts, user drives git, respect the project) never bends. Standards from rules/, playbooks from skills/, tools from the deployed MCP bridges, metered on the 'cody' slot, no MCL/signing/wallet surface. The client ships a coding workspace (chat + mode dial, file tree, diff review, terminal, preview) that shows the result, not the protocol. Deploy is user-driven."
